{
 "type": "doc",
 "content": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "A wiki works when people can find things. This page shows where everything is."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The sidebar"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The sidebar belongs to a space. From top to bottom you see your spaces, the name of this space, Home, Overview, the shortcuts of the space, and the tree of its pages."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Type in "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Filter pages",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "bold"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " to narrow the tree. Drag a row to move a page. Hover over a row and press the three dots for more."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Searching"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Press "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "/",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " anywhere to jump to the search box. Results appear while you type, and the arrow keys move through them. Inside a space, a chip keeps the search in that space. Backspace removes the chip."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Shortcuts"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Press "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "?",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " to see every keyboard shortcut. You can turn them off in your preferences."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Your own lists"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The star at the top of a page adds it to your favourites. Recent shows where you have been and what you worked on. Both are only yours."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Try these"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Open this page in the editor to tick them off."
